"},"description":{"1":"                                                                                                <h2>BARRA DE SONIDO 2.0 NESSYE DROXIO RGB BT USB<\/h2><p>Droxio te trae la barra de sonido BT que te va a sorprender, NESSYE, y ya puedes tenerla.<br><\/p><p><p>Barra de Sonido Gaming con 10w de potencia, luz RGB con 5 modos y conectividad Bluetooth 5.0 + Jack 3.5mm. Disfruta de una calidad de sonido impresionante y una iluminaci\u00f3n LED RGB que agrega estilo a tu espacio de juego. \u00a1Haz de cada juego una experiencia inolvidable!<\/p><h2>Especificaciones t\u00e9cnicas:<\/h2><p><ul><li>Alimentaci\u00f3n: USB 5V<\/li><li>Driver: 2x50mm<\/li><li>Potencia rms: 6w<\/li><li>Retroiluminaci\u00f3n: RGB Led 3 Modos<\/li><li>Conexiones: 3.5mm sonido + micr\u00f3fono. Bluetooth 4.2.<\/li><li>Dimensiones: 440 x83 x88 mm.<\/li><li>Peso.- 785gr<\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><\/p>                                                                                        ","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"DROXIO","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0.95,"unit_price":20.8,"unit_price_tax":20.8,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Altavoces","sub_category":"Barras de sonido","quantity":0,"brand":"DROXIO","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_3go-alt%20droxio%20nessye_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":15.8}}},"8436531559014":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["8436531559014",false],"wholesale_price":[7.15,false],"price":[12.15,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 0.05",false],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":[